1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 16=

10
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,640
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

11
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:50,560
Greetings.

12
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:51,790
What is it you need of me?

13
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:54,070
Yuan,

14
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,790
we have good news for you.

15
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:58,520
We found a lead on Consort Great Liu.

16
00:00:59,790 --> 00:01:01,470
That's the first good news.

17
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:03,030
We have a second.

18
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:04,510
Yuan,

19
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:07,590
without you,

20
00:01:07,710 --> 00:01:09,480
the Qi family would already be finished.

21
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,100
The key to the Marquis Yongping Residence

22
00:01:11,150 --> 00:01:12,480
should be given to you.

23
00:01:12,590 --> 00:01:13,350
As for Zhao,

24
00:01:13,790 --> 00:01:15,310
I already sent him back to our hometown

25
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,840
to reflect on his mistakes.

26
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:18,760
His mother went with him.

27
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,070
From now on,

28
00:01:20,300 --> 00:01:21,970
no one in this household will oppose you.

29
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,430
(The Chief)
The key to the Marquis Yongping Residence

30
00:01:26,560 --> 00:01:27,480
is yours now.

31
00:01:38,560 --> 00:01:39,790
I only came to ask

32
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:41,950
what really happened in my past life.

33
00:01:42,510 --> 00:01:43,760
Did she not tell you?

34
00:01:44,710 --> 00:01:46,280
You ran errands for her day and night,

35
00:01:46,950 --> 00:01:49,840
I thought
you two were close beyond words.

36
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:51,400
Just answer the question.

37
00:01:51,710 --> 00:01:52,950
Spare me the commentary.

38
00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:55,430
My past life, huh...

39
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:57,920
In my past life,

40
00:01:59,150 --> 00:02:01,230
I was with her on our wedding night...

41
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,710
I won the empire.

42
00:02:13,150 --> 00:02:14,030
You were afraid.

43
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:16,840
So you lied to her and said
you would marry her.

44
00:02:17,310 --> 00:02:18,470
When she was overjoyed

45
00:02:18,470 --> 00:02:19,870
and put on her bridal gown,

46
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,910
you sent her to me

47
00:02:22,030 --> 00:02:25,470
in exchange for your bright future.

48
00:02:25,470 --> 00:02:26,400
This is ludicrous!

49
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:27,800
I thought

50
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:29,630
I could learn the truth from you.

51
00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:31,150
I know myself.

52
00:02:31,310 --> 00:02:33,240
I would never do something like that.

53
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:36,000
Why did she not tell you the truth?

54
00:02:36,750 --> 00:02:37,870
Xiao Yunting.

55
00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:40,710
She hates me.

56
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:43,280
But she hates you even more.

57
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,280
I know her better than you do.

58
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:48,240
After she used you to kill me,

59
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:51,400
you would be the next to die.

60
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,840
If she wanted my life,

61
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,430
I would gladly die by her hand.

62
00:03:18,590 --> 00:03:20,280
What can you do for her?

63
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:30,980
(Prince Jing Residence)

64
00:03:31,460 --> 00:03:33,740
(Talisman)

65
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,430
When she was overjoyed

66
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,800
and put on her bridal gown,

67
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,840
you sent her to me

68
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:44,470
in exchange for your bright future.

69
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:46,600
♪I have loved for your sake♪

70
00:03:46,630 --> 00:03:47,470
(Qi Yuan,)

71
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:50,680
(the one who hurt you the deepest)

72
00:03:51,870 --> 00:03:53,470
(was me.)

73
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:55,430
Xiao Yunting,

74
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:56,680
listen.

75
00:03:56,750 --> 00:03:59,750
You still owe me from our previous life.

76
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,590
You are not allowed to die.

77
00:04:04,210 --> 00:04:08,430
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

78
00:04:11,030 --> 00:04:11,560
Was it real

79
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:13,000
that night?

80
00:04:13,310 --> 00:04:14,080
Xiao Yunting,

81
00:04:15,310 --> 00:04:16,600
our cooperation

82
00:04:17,410 --> 00:04:18,190
is over.

83
00:04:32,630 --> 00:04:34,680
My father found this score in Jiangxi.

84
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,830
It seems to be the work
of Consort Great Liu.

85
00:04:38,950 --> 00:04:40,070
Now Consort Little Liu

86
00:04:40,070 --> 00:04:41,750
has many eyes and ears in the palace.

87
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,950
I fear

88
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,240
that if I send it
straight to His Majesty,

89
00:04:45,390 --> 00:04:46,920
(Qionghua Tune)
the news may leak.

90
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:48,700
So I ask Your Highness
to look at it first.

91
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:51,430
This is Consort Great Liu's handwriting.

92
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:54,870
But the break here is strange.

93
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,510
It looks like a careless omission,

94
00:04:57,750 --> 00:04:58,600
but in truth,

95
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:01,830
the melody before and after
cannot be joined.

96
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:05,720
It seems deliberate.

97
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:10,720
Consort Great Liu must have meant
to send a message through this score.

98
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,600
His Majesty and Consort Great Liu

99
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,270
used to enjoy this game.

100
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,680
They would alter a score

101
00:05:15,700 --> 00:05:16,990
and pass messages to each other.

102
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:17,870
Look.

103
00:05:18,830 --> 00:05:21,120
These three unusual pauses

104
00:05:21,830 --> 00:05:24,430
are exactly the same
as the marks they used

105
00:05:24,430 --> 00:05:26,870
in the Xuanji Score.

106
00:05:27,390 --> 00:05:28,430
Xuanji Score?

107
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:32,040
It's a secret record of the rules

108
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:35,120
for deciphering their musical riddles.

109
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,560
After Consort Great Liu went missing,

110
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,480
His Majesty had an identical pavilion

111
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:42,600
built in the palace.

112
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,070
That secret record

113
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:46,870
should be kept in the music room there.

114
00:05:47,630 --> 00:05:49,720
Who is in charge of Siliu Pavilion now?

115
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:51,510
Consort Little Liu runs it.

116
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,920
You want to go in?

117
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,830
You brought Prince Qi to such ruin.

118
00:05:57,160 --> 00:05:58,830
Consort Little Liu hates you to the bone.

119
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:00,920
You can get into the palace easily,

120
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:01,920
but I'm afraid

121
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,680
it will be hard to get out unharmed.

122
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:05,800
All the more reason

123
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,560
to crack this score.

124
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,310
Only by finding Consort Great Liu

125
00:06:09,510 --> 00:06:11,680
and exposing the truth of their feud

126
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:13,920
can we clear the Prince Consort's name.

127
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:16,320
As well as root out
Prince Qi's faction once and for all.

128
00:06:18,920 --> 00:06:19,560
Very well.

129
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,240
I will find a way
to send you into Siliu Pavilion.

130
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:23,630
You ought to be careful.

131
00:06:23,870 --> 00:06:25,680
Do not let yourself be harmed.

132
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:30,430
By imperial decree
of the Consort Little Liu,

133
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:33,630
her elder sister, Consort Great Liu,
has been missing for many years.

134
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:37,600
The Eldest Princess fasted and prayed
at Baiyun Temple

135
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:39,070
and moved Heaven

136
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:39,790
to receive a sign

137
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:43,070
that a noble lady
with a strong fire-and-earth birth chart

138
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,940
must be brought to Siliu Pavilion
to recite scriptures

139
00:06:44,950 --> 00:06:46,720
to pray for peace.

140
00:06:47,020 --> 00:06:49,310
After checking, Qi Yuan
of the Marquis Yongping Residence

141
00:06:49,310 --> 00:06:50,870
is the perfect match.

142
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:53,070
So she is to be sent to the palace

143
00:06:53,270 --> 00:06:55,000
at once.

144
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,430
Qi Yuan,

145
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,830
I want to see

146
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:01,360
what you are capable of.

147
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:11,260
(Mingyue Pavilion)

148
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,390
Entering the palace was your plan?

149
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,360
I need to find evidence
in Siliu Pavilion.

150
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:17,160
Tell me where it is.

151
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:17,920
I'll go find it.

152
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,470
Consort Little Liu hates you to the bone.

153
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,270
Going now
is like walking into a tiger's den.

154
00:07:21,600 --> 00:07:22,600
That is the inner palace.

155
00:07:22,690 --> 00:07:24,310
How could someone of your status break in?

156
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,600
Now that Prince Qi is under house arrest,

157
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:31,660
this is our best chance
to find Consort Great Liu.

158
00:07:31,950 --> 00:07:32,870
We can't wait.

159
00:07:34,830 --> 00:07:36,040
I have my own way to handle it.

160
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:37,120
I know

161
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,630
our cooperation is over,

162
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,240
but you're taking too great a risk

163
00:07:40,270 --> 00:07:41,800
on your own.

164
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,360
Qi Yuan,

165
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:46,360
I'd rather be the blade in your hand

166
00:07:46,830 --> 00:07:48,160
as long as you're safe.

167
00:07:57,650 --> 00:07:59,230
I'm entering the palace
by imperial decree.

168
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:00,750
Please spare me, Your Highness.

169
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:11,600
Miss,

170
00:08:11,870 --> 00:08:13,600
this is Siliu Pavilion.

171
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:15,310
Her Highness has gone to receive
an audience with His Majesty

172
00:08:15,310 --> 00:08:16,230
and has not yet returned.

173
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:17,480
Please wait a moment.

174
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,120
Is this the former residence

175
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,700
of His Majesty and Consort Great Liu?

176
00:08:21,700 --> 00:08:22,800
(Nanny Liu, steward of Siliu Pavilion)

177
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,240
I hear Consort Great Liu

178
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,520
and Consort Little Liu
are both excellent at the guqin.

179
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:29,040
Is this the music room?

180
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,750
This is the Tower of Remembrance

181
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:33,750
His Majesty specially built
for Her Highness.

182
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:34,550
It's a place

183
00:08:34,550 --> 00:08:36,720
where she mourns her sister.

184
00:08:37,220 --> 00:08:38,380
(Tower of Remembrance)
Over there.

185
00:08:38,380 --> 00:08:39,480
That's the music room.

186
00:08:42,670 --> 00:08:45,440
Her Highness wants you
to wait in the side room.

187
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:47,120
You are new to the palace,

188
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:48,790
so do not wander about.

189
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:54,630
You're flustered and careless.

190
00:08:54,630 --> 00:08:55,890
You have offended an honored guest.

191
00:08:56,160 --> 00:08:57,910
Do you remember the rules of Siliu Pavilion?

192
00:08:59,150 --> 00:09:01,120
Nanny, it's all right.

193
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:02,240
I was distracted.

194
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:03,320
Just let her go.

195
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,910
Since the Miss says so,

196
00:09:07,910 --> 00:09:08,990
I will spare you this once.

197
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,030
Get out at once.

198
00:09:10,030 --> 00:09:10,600
Yes.

199
00:09:24,550 --> 00:09:26,240
Please wait here, Miss.

200
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:28,720
Consort Little Liu will be back shortly.

201
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:30,320
Thank you, Nanny.

202
00:09:52,030 --> 00:09:52,790
Beauty...

203
00:09:54,870 --> 00:09:55,240
You!

204
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,120
Prince Cheng.

205
00:09:57,220 --> 00:09:58,240
What are you doing here?

206
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,870
Didn't you call me here?

207
00:10:00,870 --> 00:10:01,200
I...

208
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:06,150
You said
my princess consort had just died

209
00:10:06,390 --> 00:10:08,150
and you feared
I would grieve myself sick.

210
00:10:08,440 --> 00:10:10,320
So you invited me here to meet you.

211
00:10:12,420 --> 00:10:13,420
(Qi Yuan)

212
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,660
Just as I thought.

213
00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:18,030
(Meet me at Siliu Pavilion tomorrow at You hour)
Just as the rumors said.

214
00:10:18,550 --> 00:10:19,910
You're quite fiery.

215
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,360
Miss Qi,

216
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,000
please.

217
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:33,550
I expected better from the palace.

218
00:10:34,030 --> 00:10:35,670
It's just poison in the liquor.

219
00:10:35,750 --> 00:10:37,150
No better than a country trick.

220
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:38,670
You have quite the nerve!

221
00:10:38,680 --> 00:10:39,870
Yueying Pleasure House has been destroyed,

222
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:41,360
and you still owe me for that.

223
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,240
As bold as I may be,

224
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,520
I'm no match for a prince

225
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:44,870
who barges into the inner palace.

226
00:10:44,870 --> 00:10:45,320
You!

227
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:46,030
What?

228
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:50,320
I'll wait for the day
you beg me for mercy on your knees.

229
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,670
Keep dreaming.

230
00:10:58,510 --> 00:11:01,000
So, what do you think
of the palace's poison

231
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:03,390
compared to your country tricks?

232
00:11:08,510 --> 00:11:10,960
I specially obtained
Lost-Soul Incense from Prince Qi.

233
00:11:11,050 --> 00:11:12,840
Once you breathe in
the flower's fragrance,

234
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,440
your limbs will go weak,
and you'll lose consciousness.

235
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,840
Then you'll be at my mercy.

236
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:43,560
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

237
00:11:43,940 --> 00:11:47,720
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

238
00:11:48,230 --> 00:11:53,690
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

239
00:11:53,910 --> 00:11:58,070
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

240
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:03,140
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

241
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:10,840
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
